table branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n(I messed up the git in another PR so I had to delete it)\r\n\r\nThis implements \"favorite assets\", based on https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/3521 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11080.\r\n\r\nWhat this does:\r\n- Adds a Star button to the right of AssetLibraryItems, toggling the Asset's favorite status.\r\n- Adds a `Favorites...` button next to the search bar, opening a popup with the list of favorited assets.\r\n- Stores \"favorites\" data in an editor setting `asset_library/favorites`, which is a Dictionary.\r\n  - Keys are the asset_id as an int. Values are a Dictionary, caching the minimum info needed to spawn an AssetLibraryItem in the favorites list.\r\n- Syncs the favorite status for the star toggle by listening to and emitting `settings_changed` in EditorSettings.\r\n- Shows template_only assets only from the project manager, and the others only from the editor.\r\n\r\nImages:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/95c0603a-7e0f-4857-9fa3-17c9bf9d0b2c)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1012c04b-5693-4b0d-a4d4-06ecb7a4aaf6)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/81e52894-f3c3-420f-8e1b-f391b9f24562)\r\n\r\n- *Production edit: This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/3521.*","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","